title: "Reading Hidden Loss Forgiveness from the Reward: Accounting Options and Learned Exploitation in Reinforcement-Learning Simulators for Electricity Trading"
authors:
  - alias: gepapak
version: "6.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-07"
repository-code: "https://github.com/gepapak/accounting-options-rl"
